{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "M",
  "theme": "mdash",
  "_about": "M-style cluster after a photo of a current M8's cluster (design/photos/ref-m8-cluster.png, no badges): black, a dark card either side (outline only until the car's brightening of dark tints is measured: 'cardFill' 0..1), rev blades, G-meter, fuel and oil gauges, the setup rows. Backdrop, G-meter, side gauges and the setup level bars are one shader (mdash); the rev bars are mtach: 3 effect layers, since the car draws only a few. The blades bend at x 534 / 1386 and the setup rows start at x 1612 so nothing sits under the black box BMW draws at x 1406..1597, y 342..419; the cards' top outer corners are cut on the hood's slant. Fuel and range from KombiIF statusRangeTankStatus (config.tankLitres is the full mark), outside temperature from EnvironmentalInformation. The setup rows follow the drive mode buttons. No speed limit sign: no app has found that signal yet. 'Leave room for the map' is not supported in this theme yet. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
